# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build trees, build output and run output.
# Added after build-{dp,sp}.{build,cfg}.log were committed by accident.
# Everything here is verified to match zero tracked files -- check with
#   git ls-files -- '<pattern>'
# before adding more. In particular *.out and *.nc are NOT safe: they match
# tracked mesh files and test fixtures respectively.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build*/
*.log
*.err

# fesom.x run output (exact names -- see the *.out note above)
results/
fesom.out
fesom.out.done
fesom2.0.out
*.out.done
fesom.clock
slurm-*.out
core.[0-9]*
